  "scope": "PV-T04 wider primitive payload snapshot/lifetime policy only. No source, public declarations, runtime profile or version change. Current complete containers still select four primitive families.",
  "intentionalExtensions": "Bosak carrier-preserving host transport and exact raw ownership checks extend XDM API policy. Lexical validity belongs to provider-issued evidence and separate validation routes; this boundary neither casts nor proves all XML Schema facets. Unsupported enum-only/internal carriers and malformed public factories receive explicit disposition, not fabricated factories or authority."
